  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the remainder when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>22</mn></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the remainder when the same is divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>22</mn></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2022</mn></math>&nbsp;is divisible by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p>So on expanding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2022</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2022</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2022</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2022</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2022</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2020</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>In this case the remainder is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>22</mn></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2022</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2023</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math></p><p>Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2023</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2023</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2023</mn></mfenced><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>22</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mn>21</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>289</mn></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>22</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>289</mn></mfenced><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2022</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2023</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>22</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p><p>Therefore, the required answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
